<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Amylin upgraded by Vector.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Amylin upgraded by Vector.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Securities analyst Mike King said he upgraded Amylin Pharmaceuticals Inc to buy from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the biotechnology concern were up 7/16 at 8-7/8 on heavy trading volume.  </p>
<p>-- King was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
<p>-- Amylin said Monday that Wall Street overreacted in selling off its stock after the release of results, seen as disappointing, from two initial Phase III trials involving the company's high-profile drug for diabetes, pramlintide.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
